%% Sequence Diagram: Youth Account Management API
sequenceDiagram
    participant Parent as Parent/Guardian
    participant WebUI as Web UI
    participant APIGW as API Gateway
    participant YAS as Youth Account Service
    participant AccSvc as Account Service
    participant TxnSvc as Transaction Service
    participant SettingsDB as Settings DB
    participant LedgerDB as Ledger DB

    autonumber
    Parent->>WebUI: Login (OAuth2)
    WebUI->>APIGW: Authenticate (OAuth2 token)
    APIGW->>YAS: Validate token, RBAC
    YAS-->>APIGW: Auth success/fail
    APIGW-->>WebUI: Auth result
    WebUI->>APIGW: GET /api/youth-accounts/{id}/dashboard
    APIGW->>YAS: getDashboard(youthAccountId)
    YAS->>AccSvc: Fetch account balance
    AccSvc-->>YAS: Account balance
    YAS->>SettingsDB: Get spending limit
    SettingsDB-->>YAS: Limit
    YAS->>LedgerDB: Get recent transactions
    LedgerDB-->>YAS: Transactions
    YAS-->>APIGW: Dashboard data
    APIGW-->>WebUI: Dashboard JSON
    WebUI-->>Parent: Render dashboard
    Note over Parent,WebUI: Parent initiates fund transfer
    Parent->>WebUI: Transfer funds
    WebUI->>APIGW: POST /api/youth-accounts/{id}/fund-transfer
    APIGW->>YAS: transferFunds(request)
    YAS->>AccSvc: Initiate fund transfer
    AccSvc-->>YAS: Transfer status
    YAS->>LedgerDB: Log transaction
    LedgerDB-->>YAS: Log success
    YAS-->>APIGW: Transfer result
    APIGW-->>WebUI: Transfer response
    WebUI-->>Parent: Show result
    Note over Parent,WebUI: Set spending limit
    Parent->>WebUI: Set limit
    WebUI->>APIGW: PUT /api/youth-accounts/{id}/spending-limit
    APIGW->>YAS: setSpendingLimit(request)
    YAS->>SettingsDB: Update limit
    SettingsDB-->>YAS: Update status
    YAS-->>APIGW: Limit update result
    APIGW-->>WebUI: Update response
    WebUI-->>Parent: Show result
    Note over Parent,WebUI: View transaction history
    Parent->>WebUI: View transactions
    WebUI->>APIGW: GET /api/youth-accounts/{id}/transactions
    APIGW->>YAS: getTransactionHistory(params)
    YAS->>LedgerDB: Query transactions
    LedgerDB-->>YAS: Transaction list
    YAS-->>APIGW: Transaction history
    APIGW-->>WebUI: Transaction data
    WebUI-->>Parent: Render transactions
    Note over all: All operations audited, OAuth2 & RBAC enforced